                  "props": {
                    "text": "Lease-maintained, pre-owned International Trucks are available for export from Miami, Florida, and South Carolina. Find a truck that’s ready for its next chapter, with guidance from Rechtien Truck Group, supporting your business success with comprehensive parts sourcing and over 40 years of export expertise.",
